      "text": "Gemini and Sunday robots behave completely differently when the head camera is covered (and both seem like a deliberate design decision). My guess is because Gemini\u2019s system 2 uses head camera only (or heavily), and Sunday doesn\u2019t seem to have a system 2 or it\u2019s baked in system 1.\n\nWhat if the wrist camera gets smudged? It\u2019ll be interesting to see how safety would be defined around these adversarial / uncertainty conditions.",
